# High-risk code

These paths handle <auth / real money / persisted state>. Before changing behavior here:

- Read `ai/summaries/CRASH-AND-FIX-LOG.md`: past bugs in these files are listed there.
- Explain the change and its blast radius, and get explicit approval from Zack.
- Add or update a test that proves the new behavior; never weaken existing ones.
- Keep paper/sim mode working. Don't expand live behavior silently.
- Record the change as a DEC entry in `ai/summaries/DECISION-LOG.md`.

<Project-specific rules, e.g.:>
<- Kalshi signing is RSA-PSS SHA-256, salt length 32, message = timestamp_ms + METHOD + path (no query). Use `<module>`; never re-implement.>
